# extension-updates.txt
# Semi-automatic MediaWiki extension update list
#
# HOW TO USE:
#   1. Run:  docker exec -it mediawiki-mediawiki-1 update-extensions.sh list
#      to see all installed extensions.
#
#   2. For each extension, look up the download URL on mediawiki.org
#      (see update-extensions.sh help for detailed instructions).
#
#   3. Add/update lines below in the format:
#        ExtensionName   https://....tar.gz
#
#   4. Copy this file into the container and run:
#        docker cp extension-updates.txt mediawiki-mediawiki-1:/tmp/updates.txt
#        docker exec -it mediawiki-mediawiki-1 update-extensions.sh batch /tmp/updates.txt
#
# FORMAT: ExtensionName<TAB or spaces>URL
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Empty lines are ignored.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------

# Example entries — replace with real URLs from mediawiki.org:
# AdminLinks    https://extdist.wmflabs.org/dist/extensions/AdminLinks-REL1_42-xxxxxxx.tar.gz
# VisualEditor  https://extdist.wmflabs.org/dist/extensions/VisualEditor-REL1_42-xxxxxxx.tar.gz
